# AI metadata (maintainers)

Published consumer metadata: `playbook/dist/ai/` (built; do not hand-edit).

## Preferred command

```bash
yarn generate:docs-metadata
```

Builds kit schemas, global props, playgrounds, and `dist/ai` (slim playgrounds + visual-index).

## Manual sources (edit these)

| Concern | Edit |
|---------|------|
| Kit props in schemas | Kit `.tsx` / `.rb` sources, then regenerate |
| Playground patterns for agents | `_playground.overrides.json` |
| Visual lookalikes / gotchas | `playbook/scripts/lib/visual-cues.mjs` then `yarn build:ai` / full generate |
| External deps notes | `_playground.overrides.json` → `externalDependencies` |

Do not hand-edit `dist/ai/visual-index.json` or other `dist/ai` outputs.

## Consumer templates

`docs/ai/consumer/` is for Nitro and other apps — copy there, do not treat as active rules in this repo.

Detail: `docs/AI_METADATA.md`. Skill: `.cursor/skills/docs-metadata/SKILL.md`.
